OL,3,GNEWSAIs Banbury's economy 'vibrant' or
OL,4,A'dying on its feet'?
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn an echo of its famous nursery rhyme
OL,7,Flandmark, the market town of Banbury is
OL,8,Fat a crossroads.
OL,10,FOxfordshire County Council is
OL,11,Fconsulting on a redesign of the town's
OL,12,Finfrastructure and image.
OL,14,FCouncillor Gareth Epps, cabinet member
OL,15,Ffor transport, said it was a chance to
OL,16,Fbuild on Banbury's "vibrant economy".
OL,18,FHowever, local councillor Paul-Austin
OL,19,FSargent said most residents thought the
OL,20,Ftown was "dying on its feet" and argued
OL,21,Fit needed "bespoke crafts and makers"
OL,22,Fto attract visitors.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
